          "code": "counter = 0\n\ndef bump():\n    global counter   # ⚠ 不写这行就是创建一个局部变量，外面不变，且不报错\n    counter += 1\n\ndef outer():\n    n = 0\n    def inner():\n        nonlocal n   # 改外层函数变量用 nonlocal\n        n += 1",
